# Lightning Sentry kills a Fallen pack: as ass-lightning-sentry (ScnAss, right skill 271,
# Blood Moor without population) plus a Fallen pack poked 4 sub-tiles from the player at frame 10
# (poke spawn 19), one right click at client pixel (290, 310), 3 sub-tiles from the nearest Fallen
# (no one adjacent to the trap: a monster in the trap's melee range is not picked, ai.md 5.3);
# the trap's lightning bolts hit and kill them. Area F2 (q-fix-ass-traps, REC-1270..).
# Spec: specs/tools/scenario-diff.md.
name ass-lightning-sentry-kill
save ScnAss --class ass --expansion --level 30 --all-skills 20 --right-skill 271
seed 1234
ticks 160
seconds 400
channels state
variant blood-moor-empty
at 4 poke warp 2
at 10 poke spawn 19 @x+4 @y normal
input frame 20; rclick 290 310
